    <item>
      <title>卷王Anthropic又来“搞事情”：Haiku 4.5性能起飞价格“香爆”，OpenAI这下坐不住了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/anthropichaiku-45openai-20251016091004756-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 16 Oct 2025 09:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
